# Optional TURN servers for the CoopNet Python server.
# Copy this file to "turn-servers.cfg" and edit.
#
# Format (one per line):
#   host:username:password:port
#
# Lines starting with # are comments.
#
# Example with the Go TURN server included in this project:
# 203.0.113.10:coopnet:coopnetpass:3478
#
# (Replace 203.0.113.10 by the public IP of the machine running the TURN server)
